### Content summary

- **Purpose:** AI judgment on whether motion guides attention toward the next read or action; builds on `DET.MOTION.PREFERS_REDUCED` and `DET.MOTION.NO_AUTO_PLAY_FLASH`, references **`Mtn`** motion contract.
- **Passing / failing signals:** One focal cue per band, hover-gated `.breathe-link`, short entrance motion, calm easing, no competing loops.
- **Before:** Expressive ambient hero + `.glass.pulse` copy wrapper + `.pulse-amber` CTA + multiple `.breathe-static` / `.pulse-amber` bento tiles + autoplay `.ks-sa-fly-chip--in-*` fly-ins (fails).
- **After:** `forge-ambient--subtle` + scrim, static hero card, one `.pulse-amber` stat accent, `.breathe-link` hover tile, helper copy for hover motion (passes).
- **Evidence / remediation:** Screenshot + recording capture steps; 5-step ordered fix list; related rules section.

